    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present 22 Brickfield Drive to the market, a spacious four-bedroom end-of-terrace home ideally positioned in a highly convenient location. \n\nThe property benefits from a recent extension to the rear, which includes a new kitchen, bathroom and additional family room, providing a practical layout for modern family living. The remainder of the property would benefit from modernisation, offering the new owners an excellent opportunity to put their own stamp on the home. \n\nThe accommodation comprises four bedrooms, a main bathroom, living accommodation, a recently upgraded kitchen and a generous family room extending to the rear. Externally, the property benefits from off-street parking to the front and a generous rear garden, providing excellent potential. \n\nThe location is a particular feature, with Crumlin Shopping Centre on the doorstep providing a wide range of everyday amenities. The area is well served by Dublin Bus routes, with easy access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas, while a host of local schools, parks, sporting facilities and amenities are all within close proximity.\n\nOffering generous accommodation, excellent outdoor space and significant scope for further improvement, 22 Brickfield Drive is an ideal opportunity for first-time buyers seeking a home they can grow into and make their own.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nLiving Room - 4.67m x 3.46m\n\n\nKitchen - 5.74m x 2.68m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.79m x2.58m\n\n\nFamily Room - 4.20m x 3.61m\n\n\nBedroom One - 3.59m x 3.24m\n\n\nBedroom Two - 3.76m x 2.82m\n\n\nBedroom Three - 2.82m x 2.74m\n\n\nBedroom Four - 3.59m x 2.39m\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Four-bedroom end-of-terrace home</li><li> Recently extended to the rear</li><li> Measuring C. 115 Sq. M / 1238 Sq. Ft</li><li> New kitchen and bathroom</li><li> Generous rear garden</li><li> Off-street parking</li><li> Excellent potential to modernise</li><li> Crumlin Shopping Centre on the doorstep</li><li> Well-served by public transport</li><li> Ideal opportunity for first-time buyers / family home</ul>"
